<title>USA: CEM wins $1.5 mln award in patent suit.</title>
<headline>CEM wins $1.5 mln award in patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CEM Corp said Thursday a court awarded it $1.5 million in a patent suit against privately-held Questron Corp of Mercerville, N.J.</p>
<p>The U.S. District Court for the Eastern District of North Carolina held Questron had infringed a CEM patent relating to microwave digestion vessels, a statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;While the court awarded CEM a $1.5 million judgement plus treble damages, attorneys fees and interest, the collection of any significant amount by CEM is doubtful,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
